sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as User UI (Next.js)
    participant Svc as Microservices Layer
    participant Kafka as Kafka Service (Messaging)
    participant Redis as Redis (Session/Status)
    participant Stripe as Stripe API
    participant DB as MongoDB (Prisma)

    %% Flow 1: Event-Driven Analytics
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
    Note over Client, DB: Flow 1: High-Throughput Analytics Ingestion
    Client->>Svc: User Action (View/Cart/Search)
    activate Svc
    Svc->>Kafka: Produce Event (user-events topic)
    activate Kafka
    Kafka->>Kafka: 3s Batch Accumulation
    Kafka->>DB: Bulk Upsert (User/Product Analytics)
    deactivate Kafka
    deactivate Svc
    end

    %% Flow 2: Secure Payment & Order Lifecycle
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over Client, DB: Flow 2: Secure Payment Process (Stripe + Redis)
    Client->>Svc: Checkout Request
    activate Svc
    Svc->>Redis: Cache Cart Session (10m TTL)
    Svc->>Stripe: Init Payment Intent
    activate Stripe
    Stripe-->>Client: Redirect to Secure Checkout
    deactivate Stripe
    Stripe->>Svc: Webhook: payment_intent.succeeded
    activate Svc
    Svc->>Svc: Verify Webhook Signature
    Svc->>DB: Create Order & Update Inventory
    Svc->>Redis: Clear Session
    deactivate Svc
    end

    %% Flow 3: Real-time Chat with Persistence
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
    Note over Client, DB: Flow 3: Real-time Messaging (WS + Kafka)
    Client->>Svc: Chat Message (WebSocket)
    activate Svc
    Svc->>Redis: Check Recipient Online Status
    Svc->>Client: Broadcast to Recipient (Immediate)
    Svc->>Kafka: Produce Message to Persistence Topic
    activate Kafka
    Kafka->>DB: Async Write to Message Collection
    deactivate Kafka
    deactivate Svc
    end
